WEBVTT

00:00:00.770 --> 00:00:09.990
Put the collected
poems inside our heart

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:22.260
In the bright light

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:25.970
It's full of memories that
I don't want to forget

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:32.600
There were nights I look for my own
faults that made me laugh bitterly

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:34.950
We were guided to this encounter

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:38.940
Because there is no such
a thing as a coincidence

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:45.490
When I follow the story I'm in

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:52.080
The words that begin to
flow, somehow (to you)

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:57.810
It feels like it'll
reach you just fine

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.980
Let it ring, far away

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:07.510
The days that go round,
and round, and round, and round

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:13.720
The starry sky that's
shining in a dream

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:20.480
Put the collected
poems inside our heart

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:28.530
Always chanting the words from that
day, by your side

00:01:30.280 --> 00:01:35.370
(Episode 27) (The
Beginning of Winter)

00:01:39.880 --> 00:01:41.130
The end of Autumn.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:47.720
The time when farmers come
to sell their harvests.

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:49.220
At that time, I...

00:01:52.890 --> 00:01:55.520
Myne, that's enough.

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:00.140
Yes!

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:03.360
The offering ceremony
is coming soon.

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:05.480
You should save up
your magic for now.

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:08.240
I understand, Head Cleric.

00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:10.740
How's the preparation
for winter seclusion?

00:02:12.370 --> 00:02:15.580
I-It's progressing smoothly...

00:02:17.160 --> 00:02:20.290
Judging from your expression seems
like you haven't done it, huh...

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:23.130
Winter will come soon.

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:28.170
As I told you before, it'll be bad if the supplies
can't reach the shrine because of a blizzard.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:29.510
You should prepare quickly.

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:30.800
Yes...

00:02:39.560 --> 00:02:42.980
With this amount,
I think 80 would be the limit.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:45.270
That amount is enough.

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:50.320
Don't worry. I'll produce and sell
them before Myne's winter isolation.

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:54.950
Even though I wasn't planning on
selling the scripture picture book...

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:58.370
It's all Benno's fault.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.040
You'll seclude
yourself in the shrine?

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:05.340
If that's so, you'll need lounge wear,
visiting wear, pajamas, outing clothes,

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:07.590
and thick socks.

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:11.470
You have to make
high-quality underwear.

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:15.930
Buy the materials from here,
and ask your mother or Tuuli to sew them.

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:21.590
I don't plan to show my underwear to anyone,
so wearing tattered ones is fine, right?

00:03:22.120 --> 00:03:25.770
Are you crazy?
That's not the problem here!

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:29.900
Your body is weak enough!
You should wear extra clothes!

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:34.870
But, I don't have enough
to prepare all of them...

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:38.410
If that's so...

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:40.500
You should just sell this book.

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:48.290
And so, I sold my soul.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:54.130
It's Benno from
Gilberta Company.

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:56.640
I'm here to make an
application for selling rights.

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:59.470
Hmm? Myne? It's Myne!

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:00.890
Frida!

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:01.970
Good afternoon.

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.480
Long time no see.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:11.030
I was worried when I heard you joined the
shrine, but it seems like you're doing great.

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:15.490
Thanks for worrying about me.
How are the sales of pound cakes going?

00:04:15.510 --> 00:04:20.330
It's doing great.
It's popular amongst nobles too, you know.

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:23.370
If you have any other recipes,
I'll buy them from you.

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:26.630
With a fair price.

00:04:28.060 --> 00:04:31.650
Hey, Frida, look,
my book is finally done.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.930
This is a book?

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:40.180
It actually is a book, huh.

00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:42.810
But is it only the inside?

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:44.640
The outermost
paper is the cover.

00:04:44.890 --> 00:04:47.810
We made it so you can bring
it to your favorite place,

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:50.230
and have them make the cover
according to your liking.

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:54.570
Myne, how much is this book?

00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:01.700
It's 1 small gold coin and 8 big silver coins.
Are you going to buy it?

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:04.450
Yeah, I'll take it.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:11.630
Compared to these 2,
I'm not suitable to become a merchant at all!

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:17.930
This is the most wonderful
purchase I've made recently.

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:25.940
Myne, I'd like the next picture book to
contain the details of each season's followers.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:30.150
I have a hard time remembering
the followers of the Great God.

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:31.480
Sure.

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:38.590
I promised Frida to make a picture book about
the followers and left the merchant guild.

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:43.830
An unexpected trouble happened,
but in any case, we can sell the book now.

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:45.440
Yeah...

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:46.560
Please wait!

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:48.250
The miss from Gilberta Company!

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:54.920
Ah, Johan.

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:56.260
Who?

00:05:56.280 --> 00:05:58.380
An apprentice of
blacksmith workshop.

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:03.350
Do you need anything?

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:05.180
Miss, please!

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:08.940
Please become my patron!

00:06:09.270 --> 00:06:10.390
Patron!?

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.530
I'll become an adult next year.

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:20.380
That's why I need to find a patron among
my customer that acknowledged my skills,

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.320
and would invest in me...

00:06:23.280 --> 00:06:27.370
I'll have to create what that
patron asked from me, in 1 year.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:33.250
It's a task for a part-time blacksmith
apprentice before they head into adulthood.

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.550
If they pass, they're
acknowledged as a full blacksmith.

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:41.380
Johan's skills are good,
so wouldn't it be easy for you to find a patron?

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:44.930
I'm not well received
by my customers...

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:49.770
It's because I'm too
fixated on the details...

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:51.650
Now that he said it...

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:55.270
The same happened when I ordered the
tools to make picture books from Johan...

00:06:55.520 --> 00:07:00.070
I've never had an order for
such a detailed and thin blade.

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.820
What are you going
to use it for?

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:05.370
A small blade like this won't be
able to cut anything, you know.

00:07:05.390 --> 00:07:07.160
To cut a plant-based paper?

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:09.870
So this is a plant-based
paper, huh...

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:14.290
If the paper is so thin,
then the blade should be thinner too.

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:18.090
The shape will have to change
according to how you'll cut it too.

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:21.630
Such a thin and small blade,
how can I make this...

00:07:21.930 --> 00:07:23.180
Well yeah...

00:07:23.340 --> 00:07:28.180
But I'm always glad you'd do
such detailed work though...

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:31.270
No customer would say
that other than you, miss!

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:35.900
Miss is the only one that
would become my patron!

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:39.150
Please, Myne...

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:40.900
No, Miss Myne!

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:41.650
Hey!

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:46.160
If you really want her to be your patron,
it should be Lady Myne, right?

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:49.540
But she's a minor.

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:53.870
She can't become a patron without
permission from her parents or guarantor.

00:07:54.710 --> 00:07:55.880
So she can't?

00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:57.840
It was a wasted effort, huh.

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:08.310
Please wait.

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:13.230
I can become a patron if
I have a guardian, right?

00:08:13.560 --> 00:08:15.850
You, what are you scheming now?

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:24.950
Benno,
I'd like Johan to make it.

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:32.120
Now what?

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:38.730
If I'm going to be your patron,
I want you to make metal prints!

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:41.880
Metal printing?

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:47.320
Yeay! Metal prints!

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:49.490
It can't be helped!
It truly can't!

00:08:49.490 --> 00:08:51.740
It's for our dear metal prints!!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:55.480
Even if they don't ask about it,
let's explain it in great detail!

00:08:56.730 --> 00:09:00.250
The blocks are shaped
into a reversed letter,

00:09:00.270 --> 00:09:03.840
to make it simple,
it's something like a stamp for each letter.

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:08.670
In the past, it was made by carving
wood, but by changing to metal,

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:10.740
it's possible to
do mass production.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:15.510
When the blocks are lined up and adjusted
to the paper, it's called a plate.

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:18.100
Once the plate is done,
lock them, and print!

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:21.480
A printing method by using print blocks
and assembling them into a plate,

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:24.020
is called letterpress printing!

00:09:24.920 --> 00:09:31.100
According to history, mass-producing books
was made possible by letterpress printing,

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:36.690
but what made letterpress printing
possible, is the appearance of metal prints!

00:09:36.710 --> 00:09:38.230
In other words,

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:44.110
producing metal prints is the super ultra
miraculous important base to our ambition!

00:09:45.280 --> 00:09:50.200
It's been a while I talked
that much and it's worth it...

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:53.830
If their height is not
similar, defects would appear,

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:57.160
so I would like you to make each
block's size and height similar.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:02.750
I think 50 of each vowel,
and 20 of each consonant would suffice.

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:04.130
The rest is...

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:05.130
Excuse me...

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:08.090
Well, she's usually like this.

00:10:08.470 --> 00:10:11.720
But considering that you won't have to
worry about the costs, she's a good patron.

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:15.020
If you don't think you can go along
with Myne's unreasonable requests,

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:17.980
you better find another
patron real quick.

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:22.230
It's going to be very detailed,
a lot of them, and really hard.

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:23.310
What will you do?

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:34.370
Please become my patron.

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:38.540
Benno.

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:41.750
Please become my guarantor.

00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:43.710
I beg for it too!

00:10:48.070 --> 00:10:51.650
Fine. I'll permit
you as your guardian.

00:10:53.180 --> 00:10:56.010
Thank God, I'm glad you're
an understanding father.

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:56.740
Huh?

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:00.850
-I'm not his child!
-There's no way I'm her parent!

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.940
Master is single.

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:10.650
If I'm a parent, I won't raise my child
to be this blind to dangers and careless!

00:11:10.680 --> 00:11:16.200
What are you talking about! If Benno is my
parent, I'd run away from home a long time ago!

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:18.870
You're not that delicate!

00:11:18.890 --> 00:11:23.120
You'll be so noisy I won't
stand spending a day with you!

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:24.920
Who are you calling noisy!

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:26.540
I'm back.

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.510
How cute!

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:30.880
Right?

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:33.180
This is a noble's underwear.

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:37.970
If I wear this, it won't be a
problem if anyone sees me, huh.

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:40.430
Myne, what did you say just now?

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:44.060
Ah, no,
I'm just saying it's so pretty...

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:49.030
I just need to prepare some more before
you start your winter seclusion, right?

00:11:49.050 --> 00:11:50.860
Yeah. Thank you, mom.

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:52.280
I'll help out too!

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:53.780
Thank you too, Tuuli.

00:11:55.490 --> 00:11:56.580
I'm back.

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:58.370
Welcome back, dad.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:00.410
It's a souvenir for you, Myne.

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:02.040
Did you buy some again?

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:04.460
It's Tanie!

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:06.840
Dad, I love you!

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:09.090
I love you too, Myne.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:15.300
Yesterday you bought Rafel too.
Don't you pamper Myne a bit too much?

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:19.970
It can't be helped, soon we'll be separated
for her winter seclusion after all.

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:26.350
If it goes on,
dad will lose earlier than Myne.

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:41.410
The scripture picture books that
were sold through Gilberta Company,

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:45.660
are starting to get sold to wealthy
families that have ties to nobles.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:51.800
Excuse me, sir...

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:53.840
Do you want to buy it?

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:55.920
Yeah.

00:12:58.590 --> 00:12:59.590
This is it.

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:05.230
There's no doubt about it.

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:06.770
This is ink.

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:12.270
According to the master, a child from
Gilberta Company knows how to make ink.

00:13:13.530 --> 00:13:19.120
I'd like an oil-based ink, but is there
an ink that's not for sheepskin paper?

00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:22.200
An ink is an ink.
There's only 1 kind of ink.

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:25.620
Please wait!
Isn't the ink that you make...

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:28.630
Made by taking the dye
from a tree's burl?

00:13:28.650 --> 00:13:30.380
Where did you hear about that?

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:34.670
Don't you make
another type of ink?

00:13:35.420 --> 00:13:37.130
Other ink?

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:39.590
If you don't have one, then it's fine!
I'm sorry!

00:13:42.890 --> 00:13:45.060
Other types of ink!?

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:48.310
What is this talk about? Benno.

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:50.940
The ink association
has appeared.

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:53.070
Here it goes, a vested interest.

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:57.510
We already expected it, but, it's still going
to be troublesome, but what should we do?

00:13:58.030 --> 00:14:03.080
I think we should sell the ink production
method and let them produce inks.

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:06.410
You don't want to increase your
enemies, right, Benno?

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:07.540
Yeah.

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:10.380
Besides, it doesn't concern
our main trade at all.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:12.420
I'll be glad if you do that

00:14:12.630 --> 00:14:14.420
Alright then, it's decided.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:17.090
I brought you tea.

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:29.480
Not good enough.

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:33.310
But he's improving bit by
bit, isn't he?

00:14:33.780 --> 00:14:35.270
It's delicious, Lutz...

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:40.400
Master, there's a guest
from the ink association.

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:41.700
Got it.

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:44.240
Myne, you should go
to Corinna's place.

00:14:45.580 --> 00:14:51.170
The president of the ink association has ties to
nobles, and he has a lot of bad rumors around him.

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:54.340
It's better if you
avoid contacting him.

00:14:55.340 --> 00:14:57.970
Until the negotiation with
the ink association is over,

00:14:57.990 --> 00:15:04.720
I made a replacement for the ceremonial clothes
that got tattered in the Toronbe extermination.

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:07.220
Corinna,
you should take a break!

00:15:08.980 --> 00:15:14.320
Geez, even though Corinna is pregnant, the
orders from high-ranking nobles kept on coming.

00:15:14.340 --> 00:15:16.400
I'm sorry...

00:15:16.900 --> 00:15:17.860
Otto!

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:22.200
I've told you countless times that I hate
it when you comment about my job, right?

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:24.830
I'm just worried about
you, Corinna!

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:27.120
Even so, you shouldn't do
it in front of a customer!

00:15:27.140 --> 00:15:28.540
Alright, calm down...

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:30.410
You're the one who
always made me angry!

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:33.250
It'll be bad for the child in your
stomach if you're being angry like that...

00:15:33.270 --> 00:15:35.920
They're lovey-dovey as
usual, huh...

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:42.720
I've signed it.

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:47.010
Lutz, take this contract
upstairs and ask for the sign.

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:55.860
It was right for Myne to stay
here, huh.

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:57.360
What do you mean?

00:15:57.520 --> 00:16:00.690
The president of the ink
association is looking for Myne.

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:06.410
The one who said that there's another way
to produce ink should've been a child.

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:08.080
If she's here,
bring her out, he said.

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:10.040
I don't like his eyes...

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:13.410
Compared to the guild
master, this one is way worse.

00:16:15.540 --> 00:16:18.250
More importantly, come
on, give me your hands.

00:16:18.590 --> 00:16:19.590
Okay...

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:48.740
What are you doing! Let me go!
Let me go, you jerk!

00:16:49.030 --> 00:16:50.790
He's kicking!

00:16:50.810 --> 00:16:52.450
He's lively, right?

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:56.500
Myne, Lutz was involved
with a strange man.

00:16:57.540 --> 00:16:59.460
Most probably it's a guy
from ink association.

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:02.000
Is Lutz okay?

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:04.840
Yeah, Mark is taking
him home right now.

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:08.850
You shouldn't go out until
your escort has arrived.

00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:10.260
Okay...

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:15.100
Myne!

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:17.100
Tuuli!

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:22.320
Investigating for information, and involving
Lutz after the contract is done, is strange.

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:25.150
There's no mistake that it's the
ink association that made the move,

00:17:25.180 --> 00:17:28.070
but I don't know whether
someone is behind them or not.

00:17:28.850 --> 00:17:33.290
If you want to be safe, it's better for Myne
to start secluding in the shrine right now.

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:38.460
At the very least, they can't lay a
hand on her if she's with the shrine.

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:41.380
But going to winter
seclusion right now is...

00:17:44.300 --> 00:17:46.260
Myne, what do you want to do?

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:53.730
I hate being separated, but I hate it
more if anything happened to everyone,

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.180
so I'll go to the shrine.

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:56.220
Myne...

00:17:57.350 --> 00:17:59.730
Snow is about to
fall too after all.

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:01.190
I see...

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:15.830
I understand.
I'll tell it to the Head Cleric later.

00:18:15.950 --> 00:18:18.500
I'll say it to
everyone by myself.

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:22.250
Miss Myne, I think it's better
if Deliah doesn't hear it.

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:28.760
Deliah is still connected
to the Bishop after all.

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:31.510
She still is?

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:33.950
Looking at Deliah's position,

00:18:33.970 --> 00:18:38.430
it'll be hard to fully cut off her relations
with the Bishop, even in the future.

00:18:39.020 --> 00:18:41.940
It's for her to survive
here, wasn't it?

00:18:42.560 --> 00:18:45.360
Then I'll take
care of Miss Myne.

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:47.190
Fran, I leave Myne to you.

00:18:47.320 --> 00:18:47.780
Yes.

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:53.450
Myne, don't be selfish and
bring trouble to everyone, okay?

00:18:53.870 --> 00:18:57.370
And make sure you tell the
Head Cleric clearly about this.

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:01.830
Things won't run smoothly if the
communication with your superior is bad.

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:03.880
Superior, huh...

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:06.300
Okay.

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:13.050
I'll come to meet you in the holidays,
make sure to be a good child until then, Myne.

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:18.390
Yeah... I'll be waiting.

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:25.770
Until the information is gathered,
make sure Myne doesn't go out of her room...

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:27.440
Understood.

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:32.150
And then, Miss Myne's parents said
they want to come here to meet her.

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:36.660
I think Miss Myne is feeling disheartened
too, so I'd like you to permit it.

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:37.830
No problems.

00:19:38.160 --> 00:19:42.330
It's more problematic if she can't suppress
her emotion and the magic run wild.

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:47.750
We have to avoid doing the offering
ceremony in that situation at all costs.

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:52.720
In the offering ceremony, she has to meet with the
Bishop, whether she likes it or not, after all.

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:53.430
Yeah.

00:19:57.180 --> 00:20:00.810
There are some circumstances, so I need to
start secluding myself in the shrine from today.

00:20:00.830 --> 00:20:02.730
What circumstances?

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:05.400
I can't tell you
the details for now.

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:07.770
That's how it is,
so I'll be relying on you.

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:17.780
Will Myne be okay alone?

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:22.250
We should'velet her take
these with her...

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:25.750
Good night, Miss Myne.

00:20:26.380 --> 00:20:29.880
Good night, Deliah, Rosina.

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:55.200
I felt homesick in just 1 day.

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:03.950
So what if they're nobles?
I'm the one who'll protect Myne.

00:21:06.810 --> 00:21:11.710
I'll obey it if it's an order,
but, a request to sneak in, huh.

00:21:12.510 --> 00:21:15.220
It'll need quite
some preparation...

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:38.700
The window where the lapis lazuli flowers
are lined up is the place where I return to

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:49.890
When it's time to depart, and I turn my
back to you, please don't say anything

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:55.300
Don't say anything

00:21:58.050 --> 00:22:09.690
If I cry, I'll feel like we
won't be able to meet anymore

00:22:10.570 --> 00:22:20.240
Don't look at my back,
I'll go without looking back too after all

00:22:20.570 --> 00:22:30.830
If you make a gentle voice,
I'll want to run up and hug you

00:22:30.920 --> 00:22:40.880
It's all me, but because I'm me,
I want to go and find out what I can do

00:22:40.970 --> 00:22:55.070
Even if you're far away,
I'll put all my love on the wind

00:22:59.030 --> 00:23:02.660
It finally begins!
Prayer to the Gods!

00:23:02.680 --> 00:23:06.740
I'm sorry to cut off your
fun, but this isn't a book.

00:23:06.770 --> 00:23:11.540
Books are a compilation of sheepskin
paper that's written by hands,

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:14.810
they have delicate pictures on
them, and on the leather cover,

00:23:14.830 --> 00:23:16.710
they spread gold dust
and jewels there.

00:23:16.740 --> 00:23:20.050
Those with such high artistic
value are called books.

00:23:20.070 --> 00:23:24.010
I want to lower the price of books as much
as possible as, and sell them all around.

00:23:24.040 --> 00:23:25.860
Merchants should think of
increasing the unit price,

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:28.820
and earning as much
profit as possible, right?

00:23:29.140 --> 00:23:31.730
You're not suitable
to become a merchant.

00:23:31.750 --> 00:23:34.270
You don't have to say
it, I already know.
